 "description": "\n <ul>\n  <li>&nbsp;Secure &amp; Non-Slip for Any Car or Dog Size: Prevent shifting and sliding with our dog bed for car back seat—featuring a heavy-duty anti-skid bottom that grips tightly to your backseat extender. Stays firmly in place even during sudden stops or sharp turns. Whether you drive a sedan, SUV, or truck, this backseat dog bed fits most standard back seat extenders. Suitable for small, medium, and large breeds—from Chihuahuas to Golden Retrievers—including anxious or active pups.</li>\n  <li>&nbsp;Ultra-Soft &amp; Comfortable Year-Round: Designed for all-day comfort, this backseat dog bed features high-resiliency PP cotton that cushions joints and reduces pressure points—ideal for senior dogs, puppies, or pets with arthritis. The soft flannel surface provides warmth in winter and breathability in summer. Whether it's a short drive or a long journey, this car dog bed is the best travel dog bed for cars in any season.</li>\n  <li>&nbsp;Protect Your Backseat Extender: Specifically designed to fit most car backseat extenders—from compact cars to SUVs—this backseat dog bed resists tears, stains, and odors, protecting your back seat extender from claws, fur, dirt, and spills. No more vacuuming dog hair or wiping stains after every trip. Your car stays clean, your dog stays happy.</li>\n </ul>\n",
